# Supabase Auth dashboard settings (not env vars — configure in project):
# - Enable Email provider
# - Confirm email: ON (mailer_autoconfirm must stay false)
# - Site URL:
#     https://quran-quest-5640.vercel.app
# - Redirect URLs:
#     quranfamily://auth/callback
#     https://quran-quest-5640.vercel.app/callback
# - Email templates: paste supabase/templates/confirmation.html and recovery.html
#   Confirmation must include both {{ .Token }} and {{ .ConfirmationURL }}
#   Recovery must include {{ .ConfirmationURL }}
# - Production SMTP (Resend custom SMTP, do not commit the API key):
#     Host: smtp.resend.com
#     Port: 465
#     Username: resend
#     Password: Resend API key (dashboard only)
#     Sender: a verified domain address, e.g. no-reply@your-domain
#     Disable email click tracking on the provider so ConfirmationURL is not rewritten
# Dashboard:
#   https://supabase.com/dashboard/project/wgyxhcdvqqdcthoeulzn/auth/smtp
#   https://supabase.com/dashboard/project/wgyxhcdvqqdcthoeulzn/auth/url-configuration
